   {
    "id": "b37974a8-ea19-4bd5-968d-f9d7f6962f95",
    "label": "Declaration (sign before you start)",
    "section": {
     "approvers": null,
     "autoshares": null,
     "section_type": "SECTION_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED",
     "user_defined_approvers": false
    },
    "children": [
     {
      "id": "f845ff38-73e1-4a69-8ce3-825d6add32c2",
      "label": "INSTALLER DECLARATION – Sign BEFORE insulation work starts.\n\nAs the lead EEC Certified installer responsible for this installation, I confirm that:\n\na. I have received a completed copy of the Pre-installation electrical safety assessment for the premises; and\n\nb. I have completed the current Pre-installation installer safety assessment, as published on the department's Internet site within 30 days of the completion of the pre-installation electrical safety assessment; and\n\nc. the pre-installation installer safety assessment confirms\n   i. the worksite is safe and the installation or upgrade will proceed in accordance with any recommendations or conditions from the pre-installation electrical safety assessment including, if required, that a licensed electrician must be present during the insulation upgrade; and\n   ii. that safe work methods are in place as per Occupational Health and Safety Regulations 2017 (Vic); and",
      "children": [],
      "instruction": {
       "text": {}
      }
     },
     {
      "id": "419b57c6-2ec3-4661-9fba-98f2c2ee4818",
      "label": "d. I will ensure that:\n   i. all applicable occupation health and safety laws and requirements are complied with; and\n   ii. the insulation will be installed in compliance with the effective version of AS 3999; and\n   iii. if the installation is carried out on multiple days, that I will check that all items remain compliant with this assessment form at the start of each day prior to undertaking the work; and\n   iv. the insulation product/s being installed are listed on the ESC Register of Products.",
      "children": [],
      "instruction": {
       "text": {}
      }
     },
     {
      "id": "c9f4116f-17ce-47b2-9504-3fdbeec016a4",
      "label": "Privacy Collection Statement: DEECA and ESC collect and use this information under the Privacy and Data Protection Act 2014 (Vic) to administer, monitor and enforce VEU. Refer to the complete Privacy Collection Statement in the linked official form: https://www.energy.vic.gov.au/__data/assets/word_doc/0042/788397/VEU-pre-installation-installer-safety-assessment-form-.docx",
      "children": [],
      "instruction": {
       "text": {}
      }
     },
